WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.592
Step 1. Open Patient Home, the page for one patient inside a facility.

1.2
00:00:05.592 --> 00:00:08.720
From Search patients, select the patient.

1.3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:14.180
If Care asks for the year of birth, enter it, then select Verify.

2.1
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:20.098
Step 2. Check the patient card. It shows the patient's name and tags.

2.2
00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:25.198
To apply or remove tags, select Add Tags or Manage Tags.

3.1
00:00:25.198 --> 00:00:28.560
Step 3. Start a task with the action buttons.

3.2
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.464
Create Encounter opens the encounter form,

3.3
00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:36.389
and Schedule Appointment opens Book Appointment for the patient.

4.1
00:00:36.389 --> 00:00:41.515
Step 4. View the patient's encounters. Select Active or Completed.

4.2
00:00:41.515 --> 00:00:47.704
The list shows the patient's encounters at every facility, not only this one.

5.1
00:00:47.704 --> 00:00:51.476
Step 5. View the patient's appointments and tokens.

5.2
00:00:51.476 --> 00:00:56.381
The Appointments tab lists the patient's appointments at this facility.

5.3
00:00:56.381 --> 00:01:00.403
On a large screen, the tokens show in a side panel.

6.1
00:01:00.403 --> 00:01:03.178
Step 6. Open the patient's profile.

6.2
00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:08.877
Select the patient's name on the patient card, then View Profile in the pop-up.

6.3
00:01:08.877 --> 00:01:12.985
Care opens the patient's profile, Patient Details.
